<title>HONG KONG: Texwinca interim profit rises 33.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Texwinca interim profit rises 33.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   17.1   vs  13.4</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    3.0    vs  2.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    100.23 vs  75.09</p>
<p>    Turnover		     804.01 vs  505.95</p>
<p>    Company name		 Texwinca Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 22-28</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   February 18</p>
<p>NOTE - Texwinca is a fabric dyeing and knitting group.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
